      "content": "rest? it feels less like resting and more like just... fading out. like everything i once stood for is just dust. it's so exhausting to keep pretending that there's still some spark in here when there's really just a hollow shell. sometimes i wonder if the silence would just be easier than this constant, heavy nothingness.",
